[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17580.47, "timestamp": "04:53:00", "text": "怎么了？之类的，聊些什么……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17583.043, "timestamp": "04:53:03", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Sheng its kind of you to say that, thankyou. Im trying my best "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17583.27, "timestamp": "04:53:03", "text": "说话像所有人都很友好、很亲切的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17586.39, "timestamp": "04:53:06", "text": "就好像我和主播关系太亲近了一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17588.868, "timestamp": "04:53:08", "text": "正确的？如果我以随机观众的身份这样做的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17592.03, "timestamp": "04:53:12", "text": "他们的聊天室里没有人，他们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17594.708, "timestamp": "04:53:14", "text": "比如，“这人是谁？这个怪人是谁？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17597.35, "timestamp": "04:53:17", "text": "男的？这一切到底想表达什么？以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17599.03, "timestamp": "04:53:19", "text": "当然，主播会是你的朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17600.948, "timestamp": "04:53:20", "text": "与主播交谈会忽略这一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17604.67, "timestamp": "04:53:24", "text": "评论是因为如果他们对你的评论做出反应的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17607.11, "timestamp": "04:53:27", "text": "评论为什么会发生这种情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17608.948, "timestamp": "04:53:28", "text": "情绪爆发就像你在给予一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17612.55, "timestamp": "04:53:32", "text": "偏袒某些权利，这就是为什么当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17615.708, "timestamp": "04:53:35", "text": "当你达到一定数量时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17618.47, "timestamp": "04:53:38", "text": "大多数主播往往不会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17620.868, "timestamp": "04:53:40", "text": "对托伊主义给予过多的偏袒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17623.51, "timestamp": "04:53:43", "text": "他们的观众，因为我们是管道空间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17626.55, "timestamp": "04:53:46", "text": "准社会主义可是个大问题，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17628.948, "timestamp": "04:53:48", "text": "是的，这会很困难。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17632.23, "timestamp": "04:53:52", "text": "这是我随着时间推移学到的一些东西。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17635.19, "timestamp": "04:53:55", "text": "比如，如果我们喜欢，例如，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17637.91, "timestamp": "04:53:57", "text": "例如，如果我想与他们联系"}]